A '''Suspicious Scrap''' is a {{Rare}} item that can be used in the [[Fossil Excavator]] to uncover treasure.

== Obtaining ==
=== Mining ===
'''Suspicious Scrap''' has a base chance of {{Chance|0.5%|1|200|blocks broken}} chance of dropping when mining [[Ores]], [[Dwarven Metals]], and [[Gemstones]] while in {{zone|Glacite Mineshafts}}. Each time a '''Suspicious Scrap''' is obtained, the chance to obtain another one is halved.

The chance can be calculated using the following formula, where <math>n</math> is the number of scraps obtained so far:

: <math>\text{Chance} = 200 \times 2^n</math>

