=== Purchasing ===
'''Suspicious Scrap''' can also be purchased for {{Item|Fossil Essence|amount=100}} at the [[Fossil Essence Shop]].

== Usage ==
'''Suspicious Scrap''' can be put into the [[Fossil Excavator]] along with a [[Chisel]] to get a variety of rewards, including [[Fossil]]s, {{Item|Fossil Essence}}, {{Item|Gemstone}}s, {{Glacite Powder}}, {{Item|Gold Essence}}, {{Item|Diamond Essence}}, {{Item|Enchanted Glacite}}, {{Item|Enchanted Tungsten}}, {{Item|Enchanted Umber}}, {{Item|Fossil the Fish}}, and {{Ench|Paleontologist I}}.

'''Suspicious Scrap''' can also be salvaged for {{Item|Fossil Essence|amount=5}}.

